# Task 2: Sensor-Based IoT Simulation

## Project Description
This project is an IoT-based simulation that uses a sensor to control an output device (LED) based on environmental inputs.

## Components Used
* Arduino Uno
* LDR (Light Dependent Resistor) / Temperature Sensor
* LED
* 220 ohm Resistor
* Connecting Wires

